~ start

if GameState.get_flag("met_hermes")
	=> again
Hermes: Well, look at you. Bull-breaker. Lyre-player. Still thin as a reed.
Hermes: Hermes. Messenger, guide, and the one telling this story. You've heard me all along; you just couldn't see me.
Orpheus: You talk a lot.
Hermes: Occupational hazard.
Hermes: Past here is Attica, and Athens, and a goddess with a shield and opinions. That's the next verse.
Hermes: The road isn't built yet. Not by the people making this, anyway.
Hermes: So rest at the Hearth, and write down your Word. When the road's ready, we'll pick this up right where you left off.
do GameState.set_flag("met_hermes")
=> END

~ again

Hermes: Still here? The road's still being built. Your Word will keep.
=> END
